  "text": "proprium.sanctae-annae-matris-beatae-mariae-virginis-postcommunio",
  "about": "The postcommunio of the formulary “Saint Anne, Mother of the Blessed Virgin Mary” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Strengthened by the heavenly sacrament, we beseech You, O Lord our God, that, by the intercession of blessed Anne, whom You willed to be the mother of Your Son’s Mother, we may be found worthy of reaching eternal salvation. Through the same our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
  },
